{{!
    @template mod_vrmakerspace/tutorial_bubble

    The guided tour of the studio: the step bubble (title, step number, text, what the student asked, the tutor's
    reply, the demonstrations it offers, Show me, Back, Skip step, Next or Finish, Close), the ring that marks the
    control a step is about, the box for asking the tutor (typed, or spoken with Talk) and the Read aloud switch.
    The mod_vrmakerspace/tutorial module renders it once and fills in each step.

    Classes required for JS:
    * d-none - hides the buttons and parts a step does not use
    * mod_vrmakerspace-tour-docked, mod_vrmakerspace-tour-arrow-top, mod_vrmakerspace-tour-arrow-bottom,
      mod_vrmakerspace-tour-thinking, mod_vrmakerspace-tour-talk-listening - set by JS

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region tutorial, tutorialring, tutorialarrow, tutorialtitle, tutorialstepof, tutorialtext, tutorialheard,
      tutorialreply, tutorialdemos, tutorialask, tutorialpolicy, tutorialaskform, tutorialquestion, tutorialtalklabel,
      tutorialreadaloud
    * data-tutorial showme, back, skip, next, finish, close, ask, talk
    * data-demo - on the demonstration buttons JS puts in tutorialdemos

    Context variables required for this template:
    * uniqid - unique id prefix
    * canask - true when the Ask box is shown (always in tutorial mode; without the AI the browser answers)
    * ai - true when questions go to the AI
    * aipolicy - true when the student has accepted the site's AI policy
    * listen - true when the student can talk to the tutor (the Talk button)
    * speak - true when the tutor can speak (the Read aloud switch)
    * readaloud - true when Read aloud starts on

    Example context (json):
    {
        "uniqid": "tour1",
        "canask": true,
        "ai": true,
        "aipolicy": false,
        "listen": true,
        "speak": true,
        "readaloud": true
    }
}}
<div class="mod_vrmakerspace-tourring d-none" data-region="tutorialring" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<section class="mod_vrmakerspace-tour d-none" data-region="tutorial" role="dialog" aria-modal="false"
        aria-labelledby="{{uniqid}}-tourtitle">
    <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-tour-arrow" data-region="tutorialarrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2 mb-1">
        <h3 class="mod_vrmakerspace-tour-title h6 mb-0 me-auto" id="{{uniqid}}-tourtitle" tabindex="-1"
                data-region="tutorialtitle"></h3>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-tutorial="close"
                aria-label="{{#str}} tutorial_close, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"
                title="{{#str}} tutorial_close, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"></button>
    </div>
    <div aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
        <p class="mod_vrmakerspace-tour-text mb-2" data-region="tutorialtext"></p>
        <p class="mod_vrmakerspace-tour-heard small text-muted mb-1 d-none" data-region="tutorialheard"></p>
        <p class="mod_vrmakerspace-tour-reply mb-2 d-none" data-region="tutorialreply"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-tour-demos d-flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-2 d-none" data-region="tutorialdemos" role="group"
            aria-label="{{#str}} tutorvoice_demos, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"></div>
    {{#canask}}
    <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-tour-ask mb-2" data-region="tutorialask">
        {{#ai}}
        <div data-region="tutorialpolicy"{{#aipolicy}} hidden{{/aipolicy}}>
            {{^aipolicy}}{{> core_ai/policyblock }}{{/aipolicy}}
        </div>
        {{/ai}}
        <form class="d-flex flex-column gap-1" data-region="tutorialaskform"{{#ai}}{{^aipolicy}} hidden{{/aipolicy}}{{/ai}}>
            <label class="visually-hidden" for="{{uniqid}}-tourquestion">{{#str}} tutorial_asklabel, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</label>
            <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm" id="{{uniqid}}-tourquestion" data-region="tutorialquestion" rows="2"
                    maxlength="500" placeholder="{{#str}} tutorial_askplaceholder, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"></textarea>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2">
                {{#listen}}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary mod_vrmakerspace-tour-talk" data-tutorial="talk"
                        aria-pressed="false" aria-describedby="{{uniqid}}-talkhint">
                    <span data-region="tutorialtalklabel">{{#str}} tutorvoice_talk, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span>
                </button>
                <span class="visually-hidden" id="{{uniqid}}-talkhint">{{#str}} tutorvoice_talkhint, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span>
                {{/listen}}
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" data-tutorial="ask">{{#str}} tutorial_ask, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
    {{/canask}}
    {{#speak}}
    <div class="form-check form-switch mb-2">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="{{uniqid}}-readaloud" data-region="tutorialreadaloud"
                {{#readaloud}}checked{{/readaloud}}>
        <label class="form-check-label small" for="{{uniqid}}-readaloud">{{#str}} tutorvoice_readaloud, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</label>
    </div>
    {{/speak}}
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2">
        <span class="mod_vrmakerspace-tour-stepof small text-muted me-auto" data-region="tutorialstepof"></span>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary d-none" data-tutorial="showme">{{#str}} tutorial_showme, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-link" data-tutorial="back">{{#str}} tutorial_back, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-link d-none" data-tutorial="skip">{{#str}} tutorial_skip, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary d-none" data-tutorial="next">{{#str}} tutorial_next, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary d-none" data-tutorial="finish">{{#str}} tutorial_finish, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
    </div>
</section>
